@startuml Airports-SD-ReadModelQuery
autonumber
title S2 — Query answered from the local read model (US107; US108 and US211 likewise)
actor "ATCC" as ATCC
participant "airports-2\n: AirportController" as Ctrl
participant ": SearchAirportsService" as Q <<query>>
participant "REPLICATED_AIRPORT\n(H2 #2)" as RM <<read model>>
participant ": AirportAssembler" as Asm
participant "airports-1\n(owner of OPO)" as R1

activate ATCC
ATCC -> Ctrl : GET /api/airports/opo
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Q : getByIata("opo")
activate Q
Q -> Q : IataCode.normalize → "OPO"
Q -> RM : findById("OPO")
RM --> Q : ReplicatedAirport (owner airports-1, version 2)
Q -> Asm : toDTO(replicated)
Asm --> Q : AirportDTO (same contract as Assignment 1)
Q --> Ctrl : AirportDTO
deactivate Q
Ctrl --> ATCC : 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl

note over R1
  airports-1 is NOT called.
  It may even be down:
  the answer is the same.
end note

note over ATCC, RM
  Unknown IATA → 404 (not in the read model). Invalid IATA → 400.
  No X-Partial-Response: every replica holds every airport.
  The value can be milliseconds old (eventual consistency); the owner reads its own writes at once.
end note
@enduml
